WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:44.300
"My Secret Vampire"

2
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.000
(Episode 2)

3
00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:59.490
What the... Was it a dream?

4
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, hey! Let go of me...

5
00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.480
What the hell are you doing?

6
00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:12.800
I was just saying hello
to a human I'd never seen before.

7
00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:13.820
Don't get the wrong idea.

8
00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.980
Do you usually say
hello to sleeping humans?

9
00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.380
Occasionally?

10
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:20.800
What?

11
00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.250
Were you waiting up for me?

12
00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:23.940
As if.

13
00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:26.750
How disappointing.

14
00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:33.940
But who's that guy?

15
00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.380
He's kinda cute.

16
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.700
Cute, my ass.

17
00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.040
What does going to college
have to do with living with that guy?

18
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.540
Practice, I guess.

19
00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:46.080
Ugh! I really don't get
what Sis is thinking.

20
00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:49.360
But she always has your
best interests at heart.

21
00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:51.710
Whatever, let's just
tough it out for a month.

22
00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.550
So you'd better not cause any trouble.

23
00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.680
We'll see how you do.

24
00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:04.550
Here, drink up.

25
00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:06.660
Isn't this all you drink when you're sick?

26
00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:12.180
How did you know I was sick?

27
00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:13.710
Your sister told me.

28
00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:16.220
Ugh! Why does my sister always contact you?

29
00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:20.230
Sorry for the trouble.

30
00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.880
I don't mind.

31
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:30.580
I went out for a bit since I heard it was
overcast, but I still couldn't get the book...

32
00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.680
This?

33
00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.260
You...

34
00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:40.880
This is a first edition!

35
00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:42.960
How did you get your hands on this?

36
00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:45.720
Do you want to give me a kiss?

37
00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.730
Have you ever been hit with a book?

38
00:02:58.180 --> 00:02:59.480
So he does know how to smile.

39
00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:12.600
Hello! I'm Han Dongha.
I just moved in today.

40
00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:14.520
Oh.

41
00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:16.420
I'm Kang Seonjae.

42
00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:19.250
You were sleeping just now, weren't you?

43
00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:20.290
I dozed off.

44
00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:22.210
I was probably so tired
I had sleep paralysis.

45
00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:23.940
By the way, Seonjae...

46
00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:25.030
No, that's not right.

47
00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.300
Mr. Seonjae...

48
00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.500
How should I address you...

49
00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.260
Well...

50
00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:33.040
Just call me 'hyung, ' it's easier.

51
00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.370
Okay, Seonjae-hyung.

52
00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.310
But...

53
00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:41.290
Hyung, you're really handsome.

54
00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.160
I knew it.

55
00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:47.070
You've got good taste.

56
00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.270
Enough chit-chat, go to sleep.

57
00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:51.210
Huh?

58
00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.456
What were you doing with that guy?

59
00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.680
Isn't he cute?

60
00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.330
What, are you jealous?

61
00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.470
I hear human blood is delicious.

62
00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:07.080
And a human just happened to walk right in.

63
00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:09.440
This must be a sign from God.

64
00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.140
However...

65
00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.650
Do you remember the
Romanian precepts we learned?

66
00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:16.510
I think I've forgotten everything...

67
00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:22.870
Rule number one.

68
00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:25.420
Do not harm humans.

69
00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.870
And do not reveal your identity.

70
00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.590
First, bite the jugular vein.

71
00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:34.089
You must only drink a moderate amount.

72
00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:37.020
If you drink too much...
you risk losing your senses.

73
00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:41.350
Eligibility for feeding depends
on height, weight, and pulse.

74
00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:43.790
Jeez, there are so many rules!

75
00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.630
Just reading this will take all night.

76
00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:47.930
Should I wait for Seonjae and ask him?

77
00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:52.170
- Or should I just go ask Juwon now...
- No way, not Juwon! That guy...

78
00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.520
Wow, this is a work of art.

79
00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:08.076
My family lives in the
countryside, so I couldn't print it out.

80
00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.800
How rural are we talking?

81
00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:12.150
Oh... deep in the mountains.

82
00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.980
- So you came to Seoul by yourself for school?
- Yes.

83
00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.530
So where are you living now?

84
00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:23.450
I'm staying in a shared apartment nearby.

85
00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.350
I see.

86
00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:28.050
Oh, but by the way...

87
00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:30.710
Why did you apply here of all places?

88
00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.790
Because I've had a sweet
tooth ever since I was a kid.

89
00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:36.740
Mm, okay.

90
00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:39.250
So then...

91
00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.100
When can you start working?

92
00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.410
That's the most important thing.

93
00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:44.720
I can start right now.

94
00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:22.940
The money for the umbrella.

95
00:06:22.970 --> 00:06:25.020
No, no, that's not what I meant.

96
00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.130
Let's not get involved
with each other again.

97
00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.700
(Lee Juwon)

98
00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.210
Why did you suddenly move
Han Dongha's room here?

99
00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.469
Could it be that Juwon is
afraid we'll bite Dongha?

100
00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.790
So he wants to keep an eye on us?

101
00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.800
Could it be because of me?

102
00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.260
You already bit him?!

103
00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.440
I didn't get a taste, though.

104
00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.900
Seonjae, let us have him this time.

105
00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:57.810
It's the first time for all of us.

106
00:06:58.010 --> 00:06:59.890
Still, there's no need
to move his room, right?

107
00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:02.170
Can't we just have a little
sip while living together?

108
00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:03.220
He's always hated that kind of thing.

109
00:07:03.221 --> 00:07:04.581
It's not like you don't know that.

110
00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.370
Seonjae.

111
00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:07.950
But what does human blood taste like?

112
00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:09.480
Is it really that good?

113
00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:10.740
Of course.

114
00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:13.920
Is it really different from blood packs?

115
00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:15.960
Hey! You can't even compare the two.

116
00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:17.730
You're so bold.

117
00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.370
What if you get caught?

118
00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:25.150
The moment your fangs pierce the flesh...

119
00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:28.130
a sweet aroma instantly fills the air.

120
00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.410
The fresh, cool blood...

121
00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:34.120
- flows down my esophagus.
- What's flowing down someone's esophagus?

122
00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:51.110
A gift to celebrate your first day of work.

123
00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.070
Share it with your roommates.

124
00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:56.930
That's right! Even if it's only for a
month, you shouldn't feel so uncomfortable.

125
00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.100
I'm back.

126
00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.160
Huh?

127
00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.520
Why have my things been moved out?

128
00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.510
What are you doing?

129
00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:32.700
Isn't it obvious?

130
00:08:32.701 --> 00:08:33.780
We're moving your things.

131
00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.180
Who said you could do that?

132
00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.509
If you hate me, you could've just told me.

133
00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.030
Why resort to such a cowardly tactic?

134
00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.040
What?

135
00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:43.299
Didn't you say not to invade my privacy?

136
00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.020
And yet you barge into someone else's room.

137
00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.650
Do you think you're the landlord?

138
00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.410
- I think you're misunderstanding something...
- I'll leave on my own in a month.

139
00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.090
So...

140
00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.200
you don't need to worry.

141
00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:01.770
What are you guys doing?

142
00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:04.100
Why is it so tense in here?

143
00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.510
Exactly.

144
00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.440
I guess I shouldn't have interfered.

145
00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:19.800
Dongha.

146
00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:23.030
We decided to move
your room to the first floor.

147
00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.530
Didn't you see the message?

148
00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:25.890
A message?

149
00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.910
Yeah, the first floor is
more spacious and better.

150
00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.050
Um...

151
00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:51.760
I'm sorry.

152
00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.600
I thought you didn't like me.

153
00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.230
So I misunderstood.

154
00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.800
I want to get closer to you!

155
00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.510
Even though it's only for a short month...

156
00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:12.390
we are living under
the same roof, after all.

157
00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.120
This place...

158
00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.180
is not your home.

159
00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.040
There he goes again.

160
00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:36.070
He might say that, but...

161
00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:39.169
he also had your best interests at
heart when he moved your room.

162
00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.170
Don't take it to heart.

163
00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.000
My best interests?

164
00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:47.670
Juwon probably thought it wasn't good
for you to sleep alone on the second floor.

165
00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:51.886
If you look closely, you'll see...

166
00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.920
Juwon is actually the most human among us.

167
00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:57.490
Most human... him?

168
00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.360
Yeah.

169
00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.750
You're just saying that
because you two are close, right?

170
00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:08.870
Do we look like we're close?

171
00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:10.720
Yes.

172
00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:16.190
Last time I saw you two
together, you looked very close.

173
00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:20.920
Anyway...

174
00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:22.890
you two should stop fighting and get along.

175
00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:24.670
Okay.

176
00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.140
How did you slice the tomatoes so well?

177
00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:40.160
Did you take lessons?

178
00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.080
But...

179
00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.790
we can't eat this kind of stuff.

180
00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:10.790
Still, it's the thought that counts.

181
00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:24.830
Did he put something in this?

182
00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:26.090
Huh?

183
00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:27.570
This is delicious!

184
00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:30.330
Really?

185
00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.730
Um...

186
00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:40.010
I made some toast.

187
00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.500
I've already eaten.

188
00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:51.690
That was a pretty half-hearted refusal.

189
00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:54.970
The bathroom's clean.

190
00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.500
Sigh... When will I ever
finish cleaning this place...

191
00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.640
You don't look like
someone who likes books.

192
00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:38.680
What do I look like then?

193
00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:42.820
Done staring?

194
00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:44.770
When was I staring?

195
00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.160
I was talking about the book.

196
00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.000
And in the future...

197
00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:56.330
don't touch my things.

198
00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.370
What's his problem? So annoying.

199
00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.770
Wow! It's the cleanest it's ever been.

200
00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:13.040
I feel like my chronic rhinitis is cured.

201
00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:23.050
Cold-blooded... No, that's
not it. He's not even human.

202
00:14:58.830 --> 00:14:59.830
Are you okay?

203
00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:02.090
Yeah.

204
00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:05.820
Thank you.

205
00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:10.930
I don't know if this is
the right time to ask, but...

206
00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:18.390
Forgive my asking, but...
how much do you weigh?

207
00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.170
So we're screwed, right?

208
00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:27.240
According to the rules, he
doesn't meet the criteria for feeding.

209
00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.530
Looks that way.

210
00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:29.810
Ugh, that Oghwi.

211
00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.060
I knew this would happen. Seriously!

212
00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.580
So this is what they mean
by 'so close, yet so far.'

213
00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.690
And I was so looking forward to it.

214
00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:44.290
I've been barely getting
by on expired blood packs!

215
00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.190
And all for prey we can't even feed on.

216
00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:47.950
Well then...

217
00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:49.406
Let's just kick him out of the house.

218
00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:50.430
Okay?

219
00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.070
That might be for the best.

220
00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:53.390
Let's keep him.

221
00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.540
I kind of like him, actually.

222
00:15:58.510 --> 00:15:59.510
So...

223
00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:01.580
Let's feed him well and make sure he rests.

224
00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:02.860
Let's raise him.

225
00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:17.300
"My Secret Vampire"

